><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><span class=\"text-black\">Peking University</span></h5><h5 class=\"media-heading\"><small>China</small></h5></div></div></a></div></div></div><br></div><div class=\"modal-footer\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/details/ase-2026/ase-2026-research-track/181/Synthesizing-File-Level-Data-for-Unit-Test-Generation-with-Chain-of-Thoughts-via-Self\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-default navigate\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-new-window\"></span> All Details</a></span><a href=\"#\" data-dismiss=\"modal\" class=\"btn btn-default\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-remove\"></span> Close</a></div></div></div></div>"},{ "action": "runscript", "value": "$('#modal-01ea4db4-adaa-4fa3-a9ed-61f2eaf7fec4').modal({ backdrop: 'static', keyboard: true}, 'show');" },
